{"id": "2034799324182491250", "author": "baoshen23761792", "url": "https://x.com/baoshen23761792/status/2034799324182491250", "created_at": "Fri Mar 20 01:08:58 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1773968938, "text": "大A破了4k了，美股也几乎到了去年11月最低点附近。打算加点仓位。剩下的4月份再看还有没有更低。", "replying_to": null, "replying_to_status": null, "quote_id": null, "media": null, "is_note_tweet": false, "source_url": "https://api.fxtwitter.com/baoshen23761792/status/2034799324182491250", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T03:07:23.777801+00:00", "provenance": "single_post_api"}
