{"id": "2043143931584721389", "author": "baoshen23761792", "url": "https://x.com/baoshen23761792/status/2043143931584721389", "created_at": "Sun Apr 12 01:47:27 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1775958447, "text": "@9geV2DivVUAedj0 是的，加密比港美股A股弱。只要加密没有反弹超过3月17号的高点形成更高的高点这种形态，那之后都还不能排除还有新低。", "replying_to": "9geV2DivVUAedj0", "replying_to_status": "2042638805333901619", "quote_id": null, "media": null, "is_note_tweet": false, "source_url": "https://api.fxtwitter.com/baoshen23761792/status/2043143931584721389", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T03:07:13.348115+00:00", "provenance": "single_post_api"}
{"id": "2043329280730673482", "author": "baoshen23761792", "url": "https://x.com/baoshen23761792/status/2043329280730673482", "created_at": "Sun Apr 12 14:03:58 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1776002638, "text": "@bafanglaichai 应该的，反复几次才是谈判常态", "replying_to": "bafanglaichai", "replying_to_status": "2043150568219418704", "quote_id": null, "media": null, "is_note_tweet": false, "source_url": "https://api.fxtwitter.com/baoshen23761792/status/2043329280730673482", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T03:07:10.818509+00:00", "provenance": "single_post_api"}
{"id": "2044957844513198194", "author": "baoshen23761792", "url": "https://x.com/baoshen23761792/status/2044957844513198194", "created_at": "Fri Apr 17 01:55:18 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1776390918, "text": "美股过去几年的下跌有个特点，就是起来的方式大多是v反，而不是底部筑底很长时间二探三探四探之类的。今年3月的战争，去年4月的关税战，24年8月的carry trade等。本质上就是基本面没问题的情况下，受到消息的冲击而导致的局部利空。消息一变，行情就重新回到增长的主旋律上。\n\n所以对于美股只要判断基本面没问题，长拿是最优先的，做T需要放弃掉追求底部买入的想法。例如半个月内的美光，如果还有印象，当时什么谷歌最新架构对存储的冲击啊，美光超预期的资本支出，都是看多了会恐慌的那种。结果短短11个交易日就回到ATH附近了。今年2,3月AI正在重复00年互联网危机崩盘这种论调也是很多人相信。\n\n那么到底要看什么，一个是看宏观基本面就是看老美GDP增速，失业率还有通胀这些基本经济数据。没有连续负的GDP，没有连续加息预期，那宏观就没问题。行业这边，看龙头公司们的季度财报，财报基本符合预期，就不会有真正的崩盘。那么每一次中蹲深蹲反而是买入做T的机会，并且要放弃最低点买入的想法。只有龙头公司们好几家财报不及预期，那你才要真正警惕是不是这个行业过热了，该减仓了之类的。", "replying_to": null, "replying_to_status": null, "quote_id": null, "media": {"all": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2044953903771615232", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGEivahbAAA56dd.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1502}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2044953977931149312", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGEizuybsAAUcVt.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1502}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2044954044872134656", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGEi3oKaEAAjKFz.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1502}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2044954145631916032", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGEi9fhaUAA1VTr.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1502}], "photos": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2044953903771615232", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGEivahbAAA56dd.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1502}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2044953977931149312", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGEizuybsAAUcVt.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1502}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2044954044872134656", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGEi3oKaEAAjKFz.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1502}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2044954145631916032", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGEi9fhaUAA1VTr.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1502}], "mosaic": {"type": "mos