{"id": "2046957732532720035", "author": "baoshen23761792", "url": "https://x.com/baoshen23761792/status/2046957732532720035", "created_at": "Wed Apr 22 14:22:08 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1776867728, "text": "@nono0818fj 要看科技公司们财报，如果喜忧参半应该半个月内反弹不会超过8.3w就开始调整。", "replying_to": "nono0818fj", "replying_to_status": "2046957328952692953", "quote_id": null, "media": null, "is_note_tweet": false, "source_url": "https://api.fxtwitter.com/baoshen23761792/status/2046957732532720035", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T03:07:06.858701+00:00", "provenance": "single_post_api"}
{"id": "2046959367778639932", "author": "baoshen23761792", "url": "https://x.com/baoshen23761792/status/2046959367778639932", "created_at": "Wed Apr 22 14:28:38 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1776868118, "text": "大A这个月暂时跑赢93%同行，港美股账户这个月暂时75%收益，超额完成任务。\n\n下周就要到科技公司财报周了，以及60天战争免授权截止日，各个风险市场都有一定变数。不过由于4月16号最大晶圆代工厂台积电财报不错，预感科技公司们财报应该不会太差。希望5月上旬是个震荡调整而不是掉头向下。\n\n加密四年周期还在不在这个话题，关注我的老粉应该知道我已经连续谈了一年多这个逻辑了。ETF上线后它就是自身周期和美科技股的混合体。它的牛熊受到两者的共同影响，并且随着时间推移美股影响权重越来越大。所以目前这个阶段把它当做弱一点的美科技股就行。用概率来说就是6w做26年底的概率到了6层以上了。", "replying_to": null, "replying_to_status": null, "quote_id": null, "media": {"all": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2046959136328577025", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGhCfT6a8AE9LQC.png?name=orig", "width": 484, "height": 170}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2046959278246985728", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGhCnkmaAAAu8Wg.jpg?name=orig", "width": 622, "height": 1110}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2046959357653610496", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGhCsMaa8AAQ60T.png?name=orig", "width": 1018, "height": 928}], "photos": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2046959136328577025", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGhCfT6a8AE9LQC.png?name=orig", "width": 484, "height": 170}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2046959278246985728", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGhCnkmaAAAu8Wg.jpg?name=orig", "width": 622, "height": 1110}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2046959357653610496", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGhCsMaa8AAQ60T.png?name=orig", "width": 1018, "height": 928}], "mosaic": {"type": "mosaic_photo", "formats": {"jpeg": "https://mosaic.fxtwitter.com/jpeg/2046959367778639932/HGhCfT6a8AE9LQC/HGhCnkmaAAAu8Wg/HGhCsMaa8AAQ60T", "webp": "https://mosaic.fxtwitter.com/webp/2046959367778639932/HGhCfT6a8AE9LQC/HGhCnkmaAAAu8Wg/HGhCsMaa8AAQ60T"}}}, "is_note_tweet": true, "source_url": "https://api.fxtwitter.com/baoshen23761792/status/2046959367778639932", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T03:07:05.603102+00:00", "provenance": "single_post_api"}
{"id": "2051162772982071564", "author": "baoshen23761792", "url": "https://x.com/baoshen23761792/status/2051162772982071564", "created_at": "Mon May 04 04:51:28 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1777870288, "text": "4月底超级财报周安稳度过，几乎所有科技公司1季度财报都超了市场预期。所以这个阶段市场是完全信任ai叙事的，也不用担心泡沫这个阶段破灭。3月抄底的各个市场要继续持有。\n\n5月份关注点\n1：老美通胀+就业\n2：公司财报\n            光模块巨头：lite/cohr\n            芯片巨头：nvda，arm，amd\n            中概龙头：阿里\n            线下消费巨头：沃尔玛\n3：美联储新主席的思路，是否会快速缩表。日央表态，是否会6月加息。这两个都会抽走流动性，虽然下个月才可能发生，但这个月会有蛛丝马迹。\n4：特访华会宣布哪些胜利", "replying_to": null, "replying_to_status": null, "quote_id": null, "media": null, "is_note_tweet": true, "source_url": "https://api.fxtwitter.com/baoshen23761792/status/2051162772982071564", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T03:07:02.524447+00:00", "provenance": "single_post_api"}
