{"id": "2092115065768202667", "author": "baoshen23761792", "url": "https://x.com/baoshen23761792/status/2092115065768202667", "created_at": "Tue Aug 25 05:01:15 +0000 2026", "created_timestamp": 1787634075, "text": "8.1w我把杠杆卸载了，现货继续拿。这里有个潜在的4h背离。\n\n一般超级强势拉升以后，比较少直接圣诞树下来，而是容易在高位进行强势横盘震荡通过连续背离来消耗上涨势头，例如23年1月份。所以现货还没减仓，继续拿了再看1-2礼拜。", "replying_to": null, "replying_to_status": null, "quote_id": null, "media": {"all": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2092114245387440128", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQiu0lnaUAAcgOh.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1274}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2092114869017526272", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQivY40aQAAxVoq.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1274}], "photos": [{"type": "photo", "id": "2092114245387440128", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQiu0lnaUAAcgOh.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1274}, {"type": "photo", "id": "2092114869017526272", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQivY40aQAAxVoq.jpg?name=orig", "width": 2560, "height": 1274}], "mosaic": {"type": "mosaic_photo", "formats": {"jpeg": "https://mosaic.fxtwitter.com/jpeg/2092115065768202667/HQiu0lnaUAAcgOh/HQivY40aQAAxVoq", "webp": "https://mosaic.fxtwitter.com/webp/2092115065768202667/HQiu0lnaUAAcgOh/HQivY40aQAAxVoq"}}}, "is_note_tweet": false, "source_url": "https://api.fxtwitter.com/baoshen23761792/status/2092115065768202667", "fetched_at": "2026-09-21T03:07:28.312769+00:00", "provenance": "single_post_api"}
